import lib/cadkernel/geom2d.dl

set centre to a cad vector2 with x 1.0 and y 2.0
set ellipse to a cad ellipse at centre with radii 3.0 and 1.0 along (a cad vector2 with x 1.0 and y 0.0)
set point to the cad point on ellipse at 0.0
if (point's x != 4.0) or (point's y != 2.0):
    return 1
set tolerance to a cad tolerance of 0.001
if (cad 1.0 and 1.0005 are equal within tolerance) = false:
    return 1
set first to a cad polyline vertex2 at (a cad vector2 with x 0.0 and y 0.0) with bulge 0.0
set second to a cad polyline vertex2 at (a cad vector2 with x 4.0 and y 0.0) with bulge 0.0
set third to a cad polyline vertex2 at (a cad vector2 with x 4.0 and y 4.0) with bulge 0.0
set fourth to a cad polyline vertex2 at (a cad vector2 with x 0.0 and y 4.0) with bulge 0.0
set vertices to a list containing first
append second to vertices
append third to vertices
append fourth to vertices
set source to the cad polyline2 with vertices vertices and closure true
set side to a cad vector2 with x 2.0 and y 2.0
set outlines to the cad offset polylines of source by 0.5 toward side
if the length of outlines < 1:
    return 1
free outlines
free cad polyline source
free vertices
print "geom2d public facade passed" as a line
